puts":{"toolu_018zF3tmzDojFKjRrLEQeePo":{"file_path":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.form-associated-03-form-lifecycle-handlers/docs/adr/ADR-012-form-associated-components.md","old_string":"- **Form lifecycle callbacks.** Planned for ticket 03. The class will\n  install `formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`,\n  `formStateRestoreCallback` and `formAssociatedCallback` on the\n  prototype, each forwarding to handlers registered through a\n  `ctx.form(handlers)` method. The `restore` callback is replayed\n  when a handler is registered; the others are not (their state is\n  readable from the host and `internals`).","new_string":"- **Form lifecycle callbacks.** The class installs\n  `formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`,\n  `formStateRestoreCallback` and `formAssociatedCallback` on the\n  prototype. Each forwards to handlers registered through the\n  `ctx.form(handlers)` method. The `restore` callback is replayed\n  when a handler is registered; the others are not (their state is\n  readable from the host and `internals`). Calling `ctx.form()` again\n  replaces the earlier handlers. Handlers are dropped on teardown."}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018zF3tmzDojFKjRrLEQeePo","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/nick/code/microtags.form-associated-03-form-lifecycle-handlers/docs/adr/ADR-012-form-associated-components.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b493dbd6-6389-478a-b86a-02c93f0db15a","uuid":"af8f2f9a-3ac3-45e3-8e7c-93d022674f10","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:55:23.759Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.form-associated-03-form-lifecycle-handlers/docs/adr/ADR-012-form-associated-components.md","oldString":"- **Form lifecycle callbacks.** Planned for ticket 03. The class will\n  install `formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`,\n  `formStateRestoreCallback` and `formAssociatedCallback` on the\n  prototype, each forwarding to handlers registered through a\n  `ctx.form(handlers)` method. The `restore` callback is replayed\n  when a handler is registered; the others are not (their state is\n  readable from the host and `internals`).","newString":"- **Form lifecycle callbacks.** The class installs\n  `formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`,\n  `formStateRestoreCallback` and `formAssociatedCallback` on the\n  prototype. Each forwards to handlers registered through the\n  `ctx.form(handlers)` method. The `restore` callback is replayed\n  when a handler is registered; the others are not (their state is\n  readable from the host and `internals`). Calling `ctx.form()` again\n  replaces the earlier handlers. Handlers are dropped on teardown.","originalFile":"# ADR-012: Form-associated custom elements\n\n**Date:** 2026-11-24\n\n**Status:** Accepted\n\n**Related:** [ADR-004][adr-004] (client size)\n\n## Context\n\nA component author who wants to build a form control (a custom input,\na rich text field, a rating widget) cannot make it a real form control\nwith microtags. The platform way is a form-associated custom element:\nthe class sets a static `formAssociated = true`, each host gets an\n`ElementInternals` from `attachInternals()`, and the browser wires it\ninto the containing form for submission, validation, and disabled\nstate. Microtags calls `customElements.define` inside `setup()` with\nno way to set the static first, and does not expose\n`ElementInternals` to the setup callback.\n\nThe first consumer is `markdown-area`, a `<textarea>` replacement.\n\n## Decision\n\nA new builder link, `.formAssociated()`, opts a component into the\nplatform's form-associated custom element behaviour. It takes no\narguments.\n\n- **Builder link.** `.formAssociated()` returns a new builder with an\n  internal `formAssociated` flag. The flag propagates through all\n  subsequent links. It composes with `withProps`, `withRefs`,\n  `withContexts` and `render` in any order.\n\n- **Static.** The factory sets `static formAssociated = true` on the\n  generated class before the builder calls `customElements.define`,\n  so the browser reads it at define time.\n\n- **Internals.** A form-associated host calls `attachInternals()`\n  once, in its constructor. The result is kept on the instance and\n  reused across disconnect/reconnect cycles. Setup receives it as\n  `ctx.internals`.\n\n- **Setup context.** For a form-associated component the setup context\n  gains `internals:ElementInternals`. Components that did not opt in\n  get a type error when they read `ctx.internals`.\n\n- **Form lifecycle callbacks.** Planned for ticket 03. The class will\n  install `formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`,\n  `formStateRestoreCallback` and `formAssociatedCallback` on the\n  prototype, each forwarding to handlers registered through a\n  `ctx.form(handlers)` method. The `restore` callback is replayed\n  when a handler is registered; the others are not (their state is\n  readable from the host and `internals`).\n\n- **Server render.** `render-support` is unchanged: form association\n  has no server-side meaning.\n\n- **Types.** `FormAssociatedContext` is a public type export from\n  `microtags`, so declaration emit in consuming packages does not hit\n  TS2883. The builder carries a `FormAssoc` type parameter that\n  controls whether the setup context includes `internals`.\n\n## Size cost\n\n| Entry | Before | After | Delta |\n|-------|--------|-------|-------|\n| `microtags` (core) | 4.04 kB | 4.09 kB | +50 B |\n\nThe 50 B delta is well under the 150 B target from the spec. It\ncovers the `formAssociated` static, the `attachInternals()` call in\nthe constructor, and passing internals to the setup context.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Authors can build form controls that submit values, participate in\n  constraint validation, follow `disabled` from ancestor fieldsets,\n  and hear about form reset and state restore (once ticket 03 lands).\n- Components that do not opt in pay no runtime cost and no API change.\n- The core entry limit rises from 4.1 kB to 4.15 kB.\n\n[adr-004]: ADR-004-client-bundle-size-outranks-ergonomics.md\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":44,"oldLines":13,"newStart":44,"newLines":14,"lines":["   gains `internals:ElementInternals`. Components that did not opt in","   get a type error when they read `ctx.internals`."," ","-- **Form lifecycle callbacks.** Planned for ticket 03. The class will","-  install `formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`,","+- **Form lifecycle callbacks.** The class installs","+  `formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`,","   `formStateRestoreCallback` and `formAssociatedCallback` on the","-  prototype, each forwarding to handlers registered through a","+  prototype. Each forwards to handlers registered through the","   `ctx.form(handlers)` method. The `restore` callback is replayed","   when a handler is registered; the others are not (their state is","-  readable from the host and `internals`).","+  readable from the host and `internals`). Calling `ctx.form()` again","+  replaces the earlier handlers. Handlers are dropped on teardown."," "," - **Server render.** `render-support` is unchanged: form association","   has no server-side meaning."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018zF3tmzDojFKjRrLEQeePo","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011ChMYxyndi92QMYrq4Ys4s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019fiGaNwHTtWwtHavtyLno8","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.form-associated-03-form-lifecycle-handlers/docs/adr/ADR-012-form-associated-components.md","old_string":"## Size cost\n\n| Entry | Before | After | Delta |\n|-------|--------|-------|-------|\n| `microtags` (core) | 4.04 kB | 4.09 kB | +50 B |\n\nThe 50 B delta is well under the 150 B target from the spec. It\ncovers the `formAssociated` static, the `attachInternals()` call in\nthe constructor, and passing internals to the setup context.","new_string":"## Size cost\n\n| Entry | Before | After | Delta |\n|-------|--------|-------|-------|\n| `microtags` (core, ticket 02) | 4.04 kB | 4.09 kB | +50 B |\n| `microtags` (core, ticket 03) | 4.09 kB | 4.23 kB | +140 B |\n\nThe ticket 02 delta (50 B) covers the `formAssociated` static, the\n`attachInternals()` call in the constructor, and passing internals to\nthe setup context. The ticket 03 delta (140 B) adds four prototype\ncallbacks, `ctx.form()` with handler storage, and restore replay.\nBoth are under the 150 B-per-ticket target."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":111956,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":624},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b493dbd6-6389-478a-b86a-02c93f0db15a","uuid":"f3e77f75-5bd2-4dd1-9a7d-ff82093beb0a","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:55:31.915Z","request_id":"req_011ChMYxyiAWdvdKSn7vHR57","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_019fiGaNwHTtWwtHavtyLno8":{"file_path":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.form-associated-03-form-lifecycle-handlers/docs/adr/ADR-012-form-associated-components.md","old_string":"## Size cost\n\n| Entry | Before | After | Delta |\n|-------|--------|-------|-------|\n| `microtags` (core) | 4.04 kB | 4.09 kB | +50 B |\n\nThe 50 B delta is well under the 150 B target from the spec. It\ncovers the `formAssociated` static, the `attachInternals()` call in\nthe constructor, and passing internals to the setup context.","new_string":"## Size cost\n\n| Entry | Before | After | Delta |\n|-------|--------|-------|-------|\n| `microtags` (core, ticket 02) | 4.04 kB | 4.09 kB | +50 B |\n| `microtags` (core, ticket 03) | 4.09 kB | 4.23 kB | +140 B |\n\nThe ticket 02 delta (50 B) covers the `formAssociated` static, the\n`attachInternals()` call in the constructor, and passing internals to\nthe setup context. The ticket 03 delta (140 B) adds four prototype\ncallbacks, `ctx.form()` with handler storage, and restore replay.\nBoth are under the 150 B-per-ticket target."}}}
