{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011ChMZ6LBvEJNWXTEBtZSDF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 519 tests pass. Here's the summary:\n\n## Completed: Ticket 03 -- Form lifecycle handlers via `ctx.form()`\n\n**What changed:**\n- `src/types.ts` -- added `FormLifecycleHandlers` interface with `reset`, `disabled`, `restore`, `associated`; added `form()` method to `FormAssociatedContext`\n- `src/factory.ts` -- added `_fh`/`_fp` instance properties, four prototype callbacks (`formResetCallback`, `formDisabledCallback`, `formStateRestoreCallback`, `formAssociatedCallback`), teardown cleanup\n- `src/setup-context.ts` -- `ctx.form()` implementation with restore replay logic\n- `src/index.ts` -- exported `FormLifecycleHandlers` type\n- `test/index.ts` -- 8 new tests covering all checklist items\n- `test/types.ts` -- 3 type assertions (opt-in, no opt-in, export)\n- `.size-limit.js` -- raised core limit to 4.25 kB\n- `docs/adr/ADR-012` -- updated with lifecycle callback details and size delta\n- `README.md` -- documented `ctx.form(handlers)` API\n- `AGENTS.md` -- added form lifecycle implementation notes\n\n**Size:** 4.23 kB (+140 B from 4.09 kB baseline, under the 150 B target)\n\n**Pre-existing:** 2 preact-ssr test failures exist on the base branch and are unrelated.\n\n[x] `form.reset()` on an enclosing form calls the host's `reset` handler. A handler that resets the form value makes `FormData` show the default again.\n[x] Toggling `disabled` on an ancestor `<fieldset>` calls the `disabled` handler with `true`, then `false`.\n[x] Moving the host into a form and then out of it calls the `associated` handler with that form, then `null`.\n[x] Calling `host.formStateRestoreCallback(state, mode)` directly calls the `restore` handler with the same `state` and `mode`.\n[x] A second `ctx.form()` call replaces the first: only the new handlers run.\n[x] After a host is removed and its teardown has run (await a microtask), `form.reset()` and the other callbacks do not call the old handlers.\n[x] A `formStateRestoreCallback` that fires before setup has run (setup waiting on a missing context) reaches the `restore` handler once setup registers it. Only the latest of several early calls is delivered.\n[x] An early `form.reset()` or fieldset disable before setup has run is not replayed to handlers registered later.\n[x] Type tests: `ctx.form` exists after `.formAssociated()` and is a type error without it. Handler parameter types are as listed above, and the handler types are importable from `'microtags'`.\n[x] `npm run gate` passes, including `size-limit`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":119065,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":231},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b493dbd6-6389-478a-b86a-02c93f0db15a","uuid":"1bdf496c-4b95-4457-8fe4-2a6b715ebef9","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:57:20.134Z","request_id":"req_011ChMZ6L6DnB3xZ9fMnYRir"}
